      "html": "II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹ֫מֶר</span></big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>] <strong>montão</strong> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲמוֹר\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲמוֹר\", dir=\"rtl\">i. חֲמוֹר</a>)—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> construto <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מַיִם רַבִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:15\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.15\">Hb 3:15</a> <em>um montão de grandes águas</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָם</span>)—mas o texto é duvidoso, ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָמַר\" href=\"/BDB,_חָמַר\", dir=\"rtl\">I. חמר</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֳמָרִים חֳמָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:10\" href=\"/Exodus.8.10\">Ex 8:10</a> (J), das rãs mortas reunidas em <em>montões</em>.",
