      "preview": "חֲמִשִּׁים: cinquenta.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִּׁים</span></big><sub>164</sub>  <strong>substantivo plural:</strong> (um) <strong>cinquenta (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">خَمْسُونَ</span> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܰܡܫܝܺܢ</span>, fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">חמשם</span>; MI<sup>28</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">חמשן</span>; assírio <em>ḫamšâti</em> Dl em Lotz<sup>TP 80</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִּׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:15\" href=\"/Genesis.6.15\">Gn 6:15</a> + 154 vezes (incluindo <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.25\">Ez 40:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:33\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.33\">33</a>, suprimidos por Co) + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.12\">Ez 45:12</a> (assim leem A Hi Co em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">חמשׁה</span>); com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשֶּׁיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.10\">2 K 1:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.12\">12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשָּׁיו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.9\">2 K 1:9</a> + 4 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשֵּׁיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.14\">2 K 1:14</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  absoluto <strong>a.</strong>  <em>um cinquenta</em>, um grupo de cinquenta <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:21\" href=\"/Exodus.18.21\">Ex 18:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:25\" href=\"/Exodus.18.25\">25</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.15\">Dt 1:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.12\">1 S 8:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.9\">2 K 1:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 13 vezes <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1\" href=\"/II_Kings.1\">2 K 1</a> (no versículo <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.14\">14</a> = <em>grupos de cinquenta</em>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.3\">Is 3:3</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  alhures, sem substantivo expresso, (1) sem outro numeral <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:30\" href=\"/Numbers.31.30\">Nu 31:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:47\" href=\"/Numbers.31.47\">47</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.18\">Ez 27:18</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:16\" href=\"/Haggai.2.16\">Hg 2:16</a>; (2) com outro numeral <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> precedendo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:23\" href=\"/Exodus.30.23\">Ex 30:23</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 11 vezes; + <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.34\">1 Ch 12:34</a> Baer, van d. H. versículo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.33\">33</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">אלף</span>); (3) <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> seguindo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:26\" href=\"/Exodus.38.26\">Ex 38:26</a> + 10 vezes; (4) <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> entre outros numerais <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:23\" href=\"/Numbers.1.23\">Nu 1:23</a> + 23 vezes<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִּׁים</span> sem outro numeral: <strong>a.</strong>  antes do substantivo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:15\" href=\"/Genesis.6.15\">Gn 6:15</a> + 58 vezes + <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ בָּאַמָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:12\" href=\"/Exodus.38.12\">Ex 38:12</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  depois do substantivo <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.24\">2 S 24:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:11\" href=\"/Exodus.26.11\">Ex 26:11</a> + 4 vezes em Crônicas.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> antes de outro numeral: <strong>a.</strong>  seguido de substantivo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:24\" href=\"/Genesis.7.24\">Gn 7:24</a> +. <strong>b.</strong>  precedido de substantivo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.21\">1 Ch 5:21</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> depois de outro numeral, e <strong>a.</strong>  este depois do substantivo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.40\">1 Ch 8:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:3\" href=\"/Ezra.8.3\">Ezr 8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:26\" href=\"/Ezra.8.26\">26</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  substantivo repetido, p. ex. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:28\" href=\"/Genesis.9.28\">Gn 9:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:29\" href=\"/Genesis.9.29\">29</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> precedido de construto, p. ex. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּשְׁנַת ח׳ שָׁנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.23\">2 K 15:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.10\">Lv 15:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.11\">11</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> = ordinal, <em>quinquagésimo</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.10\">Lv 25:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.23\">2 K 15:23</a>, cf. versículo <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.27\">27</a>.",
