      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִישִׁי</span></big>  <strong>masculino</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִישִׁית</span> <strong>feminino, adjetivo numeral ordinal: quinto</strong>;—<strong>masculino</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִישִׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:23\" href=\"/Genesis.1.23\">Gn 1:23</a> + 22 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.3\">Zc 7:3</a> + 3 vezes; <strong>feminino</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִישִׁית</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.25\">1 K 14:25</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.25\">Lv 19:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.9\">Je 36:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִּׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.31\">1 K 6:31</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִישִׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.15\">Lv 27:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.19\">19</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִישִׁתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.16\">Lv 5:16</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִׁיתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.14\">Lv 22:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.31\">27:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִׁתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.27\">Lv 27:27</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִׁתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.24\">Lv 5:24</a>, ler <span dir=\"rtl\">תוֹ</span>- Sam. Di (ver este);—<em>quinto</em>, geralmente na enumeração de dias, meses, anos, filhos, etc.; definido, exceto masculino <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:23\" href=\"/Genesis.1.23\">Gn 1:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:17\" href=\"/Genesis.30.17\">30:17</a>, feminino <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:24\" href=\"/Genesis.47.24\">Gn 47:24</a>; 1 <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.31\">6:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.5\">Ne 6:5</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong>masculino</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:23\" href=\"/Genesis.1.23\">Gn 1:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:36\" href=\"/Numbers.7.36\">Nu 7:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 29:26\" href=\"/Numbers.29.26\">29:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:38\" href=\"/Numbers.33.38\">33:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:24\" href=\"/Joshua.19.24\">Jos 19:24</a> (todos P), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:17\" href=\"/Genesis.30.17\">Gn 30:17</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:8\" href=\"/Judges.19.8\">Ju 19:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.8\">2 K 25:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.3\">Je 1:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.1\">28:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.12\">52:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.3\">Zc 7:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.8\">1 Ch 27:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:8\" href=\"/Ezra.7.8\">Ezr 7:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:9\" href=\"/Ezra.7.9\">9</a>; substantivo omitido <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.4\">2 S 3:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.14\">1 Ch 2:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.3\">3:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.2\">8:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.3\">26:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.4\">4</a> (todos de <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּן</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.9\">1 Ch 24:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.12\">25:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(גּוֹרָל)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:19\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.19\">Zc 8:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(חֹדֶשׁ)</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.8\">1 Ch 27:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(יוֹם)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong>feminino</strong> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.25\">Lv 19:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.25\">1 K 14:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.9\">Je 36:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.2\">Ez 1:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 12:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.12.2\">2 Ch 12:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּעַם ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.5\">Ne 6:5</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשִּׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.31\">1 K 6:31</a> como substantivo <em>uma quinta parte</em>, assim <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִישִׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:24\" href=\"/Genesis.47.24\">Gn 47:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.16\">Lv 5:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.14\">22:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.13\">27:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:7\" href=\"/Numbers.5.7\">Nu 5:7</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִישִׁית כֶּסֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.15\">Lv 27:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.19\">19</a>.",
