      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫מֶת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֑מֶת</span></big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>] <strong>odre de água (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem</em><strong>)</strong> —<span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֶ֑מֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:15\" href=\"/Genesis.21.15\">Gn 21:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֵ֫מֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:19\" href=\"/Genesis.21.19\">Gn 21:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחֵ֨מַת מַ֜יִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:14\" href=\"/Genesis.21.14\">Gn 21:14</a> (ver Di), [<a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:15\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.15\">Hb 2:15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמָתְךָ</span> ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֵמָה\" href=\"/BDB,_חֵמָה\", dir=\"rtl\">חֵמָה</a>].",
