      "preview": "חֲנִית: lança.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִית</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: lança (</strong>por ser <em>flexível</em>? ver Thes<strong>)</strong>;—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִית</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.19\">2 S 13:19</a> + 26 vezes; construto <em>idem</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.16\">1 S 26:16</a> (assim versículo <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.22\">22</a> Qr, onde Kt tem artigo); com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִיתֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:11\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.11\">Hb 3:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִיתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.7\">1 S 17:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 11 vezes + <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.8\">2 S 23:8</a>, ver abaixo; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִיתִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.9\">2 Ch 23:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִיתוֹתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.4\">Is 2:4</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִיתֹתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:3\" href=\"/Micah.4.3\">Mi 4:3</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>lança</em>, como arremessada <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.10\">1 S 18:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.9\">19:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.10\">10</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:33\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.33\">20:33</a>; empunhada pelo rei <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.6\">22:6</a>; sinal da presença do rei <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.7\">26:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.22\">22</a> (ver RS<sup>K 171</sup>); também <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.6\">2 S 1:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.23\">2:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.19\">21:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.18\">23:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.21\">21</a><sup>(×3)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.11\">1 Ch 11:11</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.8\">2 S 23:8</a>, onde ler <span dir=\"rtl\">הוּא עוֹרֵר אֶת־חֲנִיתוֹ</span> (em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">הוּא עֲדִינוֹ הָעֶצְנִו֯</span>) segundo Ew Th Ke Klo Dr (não We), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.20\">1 Ch 11:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.23\">23</a><sup>(×3)</sup>; plural <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.9\">2 Ch 23:9</a>; frequentemente ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.19\">1 S 13:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:45\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.45\">17:45</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:47\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.47\">47</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.9\">21:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.4\">Is 2:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:3\" href=\"/Micah.4.3\">Mi 4:3</a>,; <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3:3</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלָטִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.10\">2 K 11:10</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צִנָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.35\">1 Ch 12:35</a> (Baer); <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסָּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:18\" href=\"/Job.41.18\">Jb 41:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">סְגֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:3\" href=\"/Psalms.35.3\">ψ 35:3</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶשֶׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:10\" href=\"/Psalms.46.10\">ψ 46:10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>haste da lança</em> é <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.7\">2 S 23:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.5\">1 Ch 20:5</a> + <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.7\">1 S 17:7</a> Qr (sem dúvida correto; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">חץ</span>). <strong>b.</strong>  <em>ponta da lança</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">לַהֶבֶת ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.7\">1 S 17:7</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַהַב ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:23\" href=\"/Job.39.23\">Jb 39:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרַק ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:11\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.11\">Hb 3:11</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <em>extremidade inferior da lança</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַחֲרֵי ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.23\">2 S 2:23</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  metaforicamente, dos dentes dos leões <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:5\" href=\"/Psalms.57.5\">ψ 57:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חצים</span>; figura dos inimigos do salmista).",
