      "ordinal": 3244,
      "headword": "מַחֲנֶה",
      "ref": "BDB, מַחֲנֶה",
      "preview": "מַחֲנֶה: acampamento, grupo, exército.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֶה</span></big><sub>214</sub>  <strong>substantivo masculino</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:8\" href=\"/Genesis.33.8\">Gn 33:8</a> + 16 vezes e <strong>feminino</strong> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:3\" href=\"/Psalms.27.3\">ψ 27:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.15\">1 Ch 11:15</a> (sobre <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:9\" href=\"/Genesis.32.9\">Gn 32:9a</a> ver Di) acampamento, arraial—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:9\" href=\"/Genesis.32.9\">Gn 32:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 126 vezes (incluindo <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.24\">Ez 1:24</a>, suprimido por Co); construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:3\" href=\"/Genesis.32.3\">Gn 32:3</a> + 56 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:52\" href=\"/Numbers.1.52\">Nu 1:52</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.15\">Dt 23:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.10\">29:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֶךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.15\">Dt 23:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:10\" href=\"/Amos.4.10\">Am 4:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:3\" href=\"/Numbers.5.3\">Nu 5:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:10\" href=\"/Judges.8.10\">Ju 8:10</a> (cf. abaixo, e quanto à forma do substantivo com sufixo, ver Ges<sup>§ 93, 3, R 3</sup>); plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:8\" href=\"/Genesis.32.8\">Gn 32:8</a> + 9 vezes; construto <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.18\">1 Ch 9:18</a> + 2 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:19\" href=\"/Numbers.13.19\">Nu 13:19</a>; com sufixo (aparentemente substantivo plural) <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:4\" href=\"/Joshua.10.4\">Jos 10:4</a> + 5 vezes;—quanto ao dual, ver <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <strong>nome próprio</strong> abaixo.<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>acampamento, lugar de acampamento:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  de caravana de viajantes <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:22\" href=\"/Genesis.32.22\">Gn 32:22</a> (J), especialmente de Israel no êxodo e no deserto <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:13\" href=\"/Exodus.16.13\">Ex 16:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:16\" href=\"/Exodus.19.16\">19:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:17\" href=\"/Exodus.19.17\">17</a> (todos P; distinguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַם</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁעַר מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:26\" href=\"/Exodus.32.26\">Ex 32:26</a> (JE); especialmente <span dir=\"rtl\">מִחוּץ המ׳</span> em relação à impureza, etc., <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:14\" href=\"/Exodus.29.14\">Ex 29:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.12\">Lv 4:12</a> (P) + frequentemente, da posição da tenda da congregação <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:7\" href=\"/Exodus.33.7\">Ex 33:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (JE), em contraste <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:17\" href=\"/Numbers.2.17\">Nu 2:17</a> (P), onde dos acampamentos das diversas tribos, cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:52\" href=\"/Numbers.1.52\">1:52</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:3\" href=\"/Numbers.2.3\">2:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:2\" href=\"/Numbers.10.2\">10:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:25\" href=\"/Numbers.10.25\">25</a> etc., (todos P), já passando para <strong>3</strong> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">6</a>); <strong>b.</strong>  especificamente do <em>acampamento dos levitas</em>, circundando o tabernáculo, de modo que P pode dizer <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹהֶל־מוֹעֵד מַחֲנֵה הַלְוִיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:17\" href=\"/Numbers.2.17\">Nu 2:17</a>; e assim (tardio) do templo <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשֹּׁעֲרִים לְמַחֲנוֹת בְּנֵי לֵוִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.18\">1 Ch 9:18</a>, bem como <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁעֲרֵי מַחֲנוֹת י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.2\">2 Ch 31:2</a>; plural (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְצָרִים</span> = <em>fortalezas</em>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:19\" href=\"/Numbers.13.19\">Nu 13:19</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>acampamento de tropa armada</em> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:11\" href=\"/Joshua.6.11\">Jos 6:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:14\" href=\"/Joshua.6.14\">14</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.3\">1 S 4:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.6\">6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:53\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.53\">17:53</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.16\">2 K 7:16</a> etc.<br><strong>3.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>os que acampam</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">Nu 10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.5\">1 Ch 11:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:3\" href=\"/Psalms.27.3\">ψ 27:3</a> (todos com verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">חנה</span>), cf. (provavelmente) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:36\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.36\">Is 37:36</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.35\">2 K 19:35</a>, etc. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>grupo, conjunto de pessoas;</em> pessoas e animais <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:8\" href=\"/Genesis.32.8\">Gn 32:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:9\" href=\"/Genesis.32.9\">9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:11\" href=\"/Genesis.32.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:8\" href=\"/Genesis.33.8\">33:8</a>, cortejo fúnebre de Jacó <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:9\" href=\"/Genesis.50.9\">Gn 50:9</a>; de Israel em marcha <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:19\" href=\"/Exodus.14.19\">Ex 14:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:20\" href=\"/Exodus.14.20\">20</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">Nu 10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">6</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <em>exército, hoste</em> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:13\" href=\"/Joshua.8.13\">Jos 8:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:5\" href=\"/Joshua.10.5\">10:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:4\" href=\"/Joshua.11.4\">11:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:15\" href=\"/Judges.4.15\">Ju 4:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:16\" href=\"/Judges.4.16\">16</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:1\" href=\"/Judges.7.1\">7:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:8\" href=\"/Judges.7.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:10\" href=\"/Judges.8.10\">8:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:11\" href=\"/Judges.8.11\">11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:12\" href=\"/Judges.8.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.1\">1 S 17:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:46\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.46\">46</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.9\">2 K 3:9</a>, mesmo em pleno combate; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:34\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.34\">1 K 22:34</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:33\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.33\">2 Ch 18:33</a> etc.",
