      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חַכָּה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: gancho</strong> preso no maxilar, <strong>anzol (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem</em>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">חַכְּתָא</span><strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:25\" href=\"/Job.40.25\">Jb 40:25</a> + 2 vezes;—<span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־מַשְׁלִיכֵי בַיְאֹר חַכָּ֑ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.8\">Is 19:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הַדַּיָּגִים</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">כֻּלֹּה בְּחַכָּה הֵעֲלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:15\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.15\">Hb 1:15</a> (de <span dir=\"rtl\">אדם</span>, que, no versículo <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:14\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.14\">14</a>, é comparado a <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּגֵי הַיָּם</span>, e <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶמֶשׂ</span>), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּמְשֹׁךְ לִוְיָתָן בְּחַכָּ֑ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:25\" href=\"/Job.40.25\">Jb 40:25</a>.",
