      "preview": "חֵן²: favor, graça.",
      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵן</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino</strong> <sup>ψ 45:3</sup> <strong>favor, graça</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:8\" href=\"/Genesis.6.8\">Gn 6:8</a> + 67 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חִנּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:21\" href=\"/Genesis.39.21\">Gn 39:21</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>favor, graça, elegância:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  de <em>forma e aparência</em>, de uma mulher ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹ֑פִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.30\">Pr 31:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשֶׁת חֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.16\">Pr 11:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זונה טובת חן</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:4\" href=\"/Nahum.3.4\">Na 3:4</a>; de uma corça <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.19\">Pr 5:19</a>; pedra preciosa <span dir=\"rtl\">אבן חן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.8\">Pr 17:8</a>; de ornamentos <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.9\">Pr 1:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.9\">4:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:32\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.32\">3:22</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  da <em>fala</em>, lábios <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:3\" href=\"/Psalms.45.3\">ψ 45:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.11\">Pr 22:11</a>; palavras <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:12\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.12\">Ec 10:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>favor, aceitação:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>junto aos homens</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.15\">Pr 13:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.1\">22:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.11\">Ec 9:11</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>junto a Deus</em> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 4:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.4.7\">Zc 4:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.10\">12:10</a>; principalmente em expressões: <span dir=\"rtl\">מצא חן בעיני</span> <em>achar favor aos olhos de:</em> (1) <em>homens</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:27\" href=\"/Genesis.30.27\">Gn 30:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:6\" href=\"/Genesis.32.6\">32:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:8\" href=\"/Genesis.33.8\">33:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:10\" href=\"/Genesis.33.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:15\" href=\"/Genesis.33.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:11\" href=\"/Genesis.34.11\">34:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:4\" href=\"/Genesis.39.4\">39:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:25\" href=\"/Genesis.47.25\">47:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:29\" href=\"/Genesis.47.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:4\" href=\"/Genesis.50.4\">50:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:5\" href=\"/Numbers.32.5\">Nu 32:5</a> (todos J); <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.1\">Dt 24:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:2\" href=\"/Ruth.2.2\">Ru 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:10\" href=\"/Ruth.2.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:13\" href=\"/Ruth.2.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.18\">1 S 1:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.22\">16:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.3\">20:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:29\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.8\">25:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 27:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.27.5\">27:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.22\">2 S 14:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.4\">16:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.19\">1 K 11:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:8\" href=\"/Esther.5.8\">Est 5:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:3\" href=\"/Esther.7.3\">7:3</a>; (2) <em>Deus</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:8\" href=\"/Genesis.6.8\">Gn 6:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:3\" href=\"/Genesis.18.3\">18:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:19\" href=\"/Genesis.19.19\">19:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:12\" href=\"/Exodus.33.12\">Ex 33:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:13\" href=\"/Exodus.33.13\">13</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:16\" href=\"/Exodus.33.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:17\" href=\"/Exodus.33.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:9\" href=\"/Exodus.34.9\">34:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:11\" href=\"/Numbers.11.11\">Nu 11:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:15\" href=\"/Numbers.11.15\">15</a> (todos J); <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:17\" href=\"/Judges.6.17\">Ju 6:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.25\">2 S 15:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.4\">Pr 3:4</a>; absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">מצא חן</span> (junto ao homem) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.23\">Pr 28:23</a>; (junto a Deus) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.2\">Je 31:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מצא חן לפניו</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:5\" href=\"/Esther.8.5\">Est 8:5</a> (isto é, do rei); <span dir=\"rtl\">נתן חן בעיני</span> <em>conceder favor aos olhos de</em> (1) homem <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:21\" href=\"/Genesis.39.21\">Gn 39:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:21\" href=\"/Exodus.3.21\">Ex 3:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:3\" href=\"/Exodus.11.3\">11:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:36\" href=\"/Exodus.12.36\">12:36</a> (J); absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">נתן חן</span> do homem <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:12\" href=\"/Psalms.84.12\">ψ 84:12</a>; (2) de Deus <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.34\">Pr 3:34</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא חֵן בְּעֵינֵי</span> <em>obter favor aos olhos de</em> <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:15\" href=\"/Esther.2.15\">Est 2:15</a>; do rei <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:2\" href=\"/Esther.5.2\">5:2</a>; assim <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּשָּׂא־חֵן וָחֶסֶד לְפָנָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:17\" href=\"/Esther.2.17\">Est 2:17</a>.",
