      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָנָן</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>gracioso;</em> cf. sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">חנן</span>, fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">חנא</span><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  um dos guerreiros de Davi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.43\">1 Ch 11:43</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  um dos chefes de famílias dos netineus <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:46\" href=\"/Ezra.2.46\">Ezr 2:46</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:48\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.48\">Ne 7:49</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  nomes de levitas <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.7\">Ne 8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.11\">10:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.3\">13:3</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  chefes do povo: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.23\">Ne 10:23</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.27\">Ne 10:27</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  nome benjamita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.23\">1 Ch 8:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.38\">38</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.44\">9:44</a> (cf. nome próprio de lugar <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית חָנָן</span>, Mishná <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפַר חָנָן</span>).<br><strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ הָאֱלֹהִים</span> chefe de uma associação profética, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי הָנָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.4\">Je 35:4</a>.",
