      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנַנְיָה</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>mostrou favor</em><strong>)</strong>—𝔊 Ἀνανίας; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנַנְיָהוּ</span>: <strong>(</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">חנניהו</a> em selo israelita, Ganneau<sup>JAs Fev.-Mars 1883, 128, No. 1</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  pai de um príncipe sob Jeoaquim <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.12\">Je 36:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  capitão do exército de Uzias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.11\">2 Ch 26:11</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  chefe de uma das divisões dos músicos de Davi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.23\">1 Ch 25:23</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנַנְיָה</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.4\">4</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנַנְיָה</span>:<br><strong>4.</strong>  um falso profeta do tempo de Jeremias <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.1\">Je 28:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.17\">17</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  um dos três companheiros de Daniel <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:6\" href=\"/Daniel.1.6\">Dn 1:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:7\" href=\"/Daniel.1.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:11\" href=\"/Daniel.1.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:19\" href=\"/Daniel.1.19\">19</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  avô de um oficial da guarda no tempo de Jeremias <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.13\">Je 37:13</a>.<br><strong>7.</strong>  um filho de Zorobabel <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.19\">1 Ch 3:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.21\">21</a>.<br><strong>8.</strong>  um benjamita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.24\">1 Ch 8:24</a>.<br><strong>9.</strong>  diversas pessoas pós-exílicas. <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:28\" href=\"/Ezra.10.28\">Ezr 10:28</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.8\">Ne 3:8</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.30\">Ne 3:30</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.2\">Ne 7:2</a>. <strong>e.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.24\">Ne 10:24</a>. <strong>f.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.12\">Ne 12:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:41\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.41\">41</a>.",
