      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחִנָּה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: favor, súplica por favor</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:20\" href=\"/Joshua.11.20\">Jos 11:20</a> + 4 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחִנַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.30\">1 K 8:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:52\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.52\">52</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחִנָּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.20\">Je 37:20</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּהִנֹּתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:39\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.39\">2 Ch 6:39</a> etc. + 10 vezes com sufixo;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>favor</em>, mostrado por Israel <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:20\" href=\"/Joshua.11.20\">Jos 11:20</a> (D); <span dir=\"rtl\">מאת יהוה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:8\" href=\"/Ezra.9.8\">Ezr 9:8</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>súplica por favor</em>, de Deus <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:52\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.52\">1 K 8:52</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.13\">2 Ch 33:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:170\" href=\"/Psalms.119.170\">ψ 119:170</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפִלָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.28\">1 K 8:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.19\">2 Ch 6:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:10\" href=\"/Psalms.6.10\">ψ 6:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:2\" href=\"/Psalms.55.2\">55:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תפלה (ו)תחנה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:38\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.38\">1 K 8:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:45\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.45\">45</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:49\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.49\">49</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:54\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.54\">54</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:29\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.29\">2 Ch 6:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:35\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:39\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.39\">39</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.3\">1 K 9:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ אשׁר התפלל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.30\">1 K 8:30</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחֲנוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.21\">2 Ch 6:21</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּפֹּל ת׳ לִפְנֵי</span> <em>deixar cair a súplica diante de</em>, Yahweh <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.7\">Je 36:7</a>, o rei <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.20\">Je 37:20</a>, Jeremias <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.2\">Je 42:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הִפִּיל ת׳ לפני</span> <em>apresentar súplica diante de</em>, Yahweh <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.9\">Je 42:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:20\" href=\"/Daniel.9.20\">Dn 9:20</a>, o rei <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.26\">Je 38:26</a>.",
