      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחֲנוּן</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>] somente <strong>plural abstrato: súplica por favor</strong>;—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחֲנוּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.23\">Pr 18:23</a> + 4 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחֲנוּנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.21\">Je 3:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.21\">2 Ch 6:21</a>; sufixo de 1.ª sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחֲנוּנַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:2\" href=\"/Psalms.28.2\">ψ 28:2</a> etc., + 9 vezes com sufixo; também <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחֲנוּנוֹתָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 86:6\" href=\"/Psalms.86.6\">ψ 86:6</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  feita a homens: <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבֶּר ת׳</span> (um pobre a um rico) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.23\">Pr 18:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ אֵל</span> <em>súplica a</em> (crocodilo ao homem) <a data-ref=\"Job 40:27\" href=\"/Job.40.27\">Jb 40:27</a>; alhures<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Deus: ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תפלה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:1\" href=\"/Psalms.143.1\">ψ 143:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:3\" href=\"/Daniel.9.3\">Dn 9:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:17\" href=\"/Daniel.9.17\">17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ אשׁר התפלל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.21\">2 Ch 6:21</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">תחנה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.30\">1 K 8:30</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל ת׳</span> <em>voz de súplica</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:2\" href=\"/Psalms.28.2\">ψ 28:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:6\" href=\"/Psalms.28.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:23\" href=\"/Psalms.31.23\">31:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 86:6\" href=\"/Psalms.86.6\">86:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 130:2\" href=\"/Psalms.130.2\">130:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:7\" href=\"/Psalms.140.7\">140:7</a>, também <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:2\" href=\"/Psalms.116.2\">116:2</a> (pois <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹלִי</span> é antiga desinência de caso, e construto conforme 𝔊 𝔙 Che Bae e outros); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.9\">Je 31:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכִי ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.21\">Je 3:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רוח חן ות׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.10\">Zc 12:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲנַחְנוּ מַפִּילִים ת׳ לְפָנֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:18\" href=\"/Daniel.9.18\">Dn 9:18</a> <em>estamos apresentando nossas súplicas diante de ti;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּתְחִלַּת ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:23\" href=\"/Daniel.9.23\">Dn 9:23</a> <em>no início de tua súplica</em>.",
